{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Titan\n🌑 A primordial entity of darkness that emerges from a Dark Fountain when its power grows too strong — final boss of Ch.4.","x":0,"y":0,"width":360,"height":170,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Titan_screenshot_creation.png","x":0,"y":-220,"width":260,"height":195},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nCreates it deliberately at the end of Ch.4, opening a Dark Fountain much more powerful than normal inside the 3rd Sanctuary.","x":-650,"y":300,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":-650,"y":90,"width":158,"height":180},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Gerson Boom**\nAppears at the most desperate moment of the fight to help break its shield with the Dual Buster, allowing the final blow.","x":-300,"y":300,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gerson-grave.png","x":-300,"y":90,"width":166,"height":180},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Ralsei**\nIs the one who first explains, back in Ch.2, the concept of the Roaring and of Titans as its cause.","x":60,"y":300,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ralsei_overworld_hatless.png","x":60,"y":90,"width":95,"height":180},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Susie and Kris**\nThey defeat it together: Susie throws Kris inside the Titan, and it's Kris's SOUL, shining from within, that finally destroys it.","x":420,"y":300,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":420,"y":90,"width":102,"height":180},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Prophecy**\nThe Roaring that Titans announce is one of the great catastrophic events recorded in the Final Prophecy — the one from Ch.4 is, so far, the only one that has materialized.","x":780,"y":300,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Profecy.gif","x":780,"y":90,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Titan Spawn**\nIts offspring: embryonic creatures that first appear as obstacles and later as miniboss pairs. The Titan absorbs them to regenerate when its shield breaks.","x":-650,"y":620,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Titan_Spawn_battle_idle.gif","x":-650,"y":850,"width":157,"height":180},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Would each Dark World have its own distinct Titan?**\nThe official wiki suggests that the shape of the Ch.4 Titan might be unique to that Sanctuary — unconfirmed, since only one has been seen so far.","x":-300,"y":620,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e_centerimg","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s0img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s1img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s2img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s3img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s5img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_knight_prophecy","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_ralsei_prophecy","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_gerson_susiekris","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_spawn_knight","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_eachtitan_prophecy","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s4","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"}]}